==Battleground==
*10 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 5.33~10 seconds<sup>160f~300f</sup>.
*8 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*6 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*6 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Croconator]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 4.33 seconds<sup>130f</sup>, delay 6.67~20 seconds<sup>200f~600f</sup>.
**8 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 8~11.33 seconds<sup>240f~340f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is your best bet for defending against the nasty angels along with ranged Area Attackers such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]]. As for Angelic Sleipnir, bring units like [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] or [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]] to deal with him. Knockback Immune units are also helpful if they can land hits on Sleipnir.

The metals in this stage are weak and not worth worrying about, though they may shield the angels. This can be used to your advantage through the use of [[Long Distance]] units such as [[Nymph Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Medalist Cat]].

